The long division is shown below.

\[
\begin{array}{c|ccccc}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{x^2} & -4x & +(8 - k) & \\
\cline{2-6}
x^2 - 2x + k & x^4 & -6x^3 & +16x^2 & -25x & +10 \\
