solution:
To begin, we can draw a diagram as shown: [asy]
size(150);
draw((0,8)--(0,-8),linewidth(.5));
draw((-4,0)--(23,0),linewidth(.5));
draw(Circle((0,0),2),linewidth(.7));
draw(Circle((15,0),7),linewidth(.7));
